- a42. “svarar … sem almennar upplýsingar” would be the wrong case. The FAQ answer in international-guidance-answers.ts is “svarar algengum spurningum sem almennum upplýsingum”. The guidance intro, which is a new clause, is “Eftirfarandi svör eru almennar upplýsingar.”
- a34, a51’s deletion, and b45 ask for a heading, a deleted table row, or a merged paragraph. Those conflict with the English block structure and with ACCEPTED-ROUND. Wording inside the existing blocks was fixed; the structure was not.
- b12’s suggested single sentence was split back across the two paragraphs the English file already uses.
- 013 “Ég vil” / “Ég hef heyrt” are the reader’s questions, as in English. Neutralizing them would change the FAQ voice. 010 “Ég fór með” does not mark Wei Tseng as masculine.

